<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="GLPenFind" pubkey="" timestamp="1794939426" url="https://vedarjos.github.io/glpenfind-fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Independent UK price index for private weight-care pens. Every pharmacy that publishes a price, per dose, with the date it was read.</description></repo><application id="uk.whimsical.glpenfind"><id>uk.whimsical.glpenfind</id><added>2026-11-13</added><lastupdated>2026-11-17</lastupdated><name>GLPenFind</name><summary>UK weight-care prices from every registered pharmacy</summary><desc>GLPenFind is an independent price index for private weight-care pens in the
UK. It lists what each registered pharmacy publishes for a consultation, per
dose, and links every figure to the page it came from.

Every pharmacy is listed at every dose. Where a pharmacy publishes no price
for a dose, the card says so rather than hiding it, so the gaps are visible
instead of silently dropped.

The home-screen widget shows the cheapest published price at your chosen dose
and the date it was read, straight from the bundled index — no network, no
